# traps, handoff and outside material. It serves whoever builds, not whoever
# installs, and part of it carries the author's name, number and schedule.
# (The file names below are the builder's own and stay as they are.)
#
# If you want any of these public, delete the line. That is all.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
CLAUDE.md
CONHECIMENTO.md
ARMADILHAS.md
HANDOFF.md
PASSOS.md
LEIA-PRIMEIRO.md
MATERIAL-*.md
CHAMADA-*.md
handoff/
material-de-fora/
.ai-memory.toml
.claude/
